Subject: [PATCH] 0176: launcher redesigned in the Diablo III launcher's
 language
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Left hero (edition line, huge serif SUPER MARIO / ODYSSEY title, Chinese
title, flavor line, big red Play, two glass buttons) and a dark glass
Launch Config panel on the right holding every settings row; top bar with
the location line and version/device pills, bottom bar with the offline note
and the spaced-caps tagline. Two columns in landscape, stacked in portrait.
No row, control, action or text value changes — layout only.
